<title>USA: Matrix Capital IPO increased to 1.75 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Matrix Capital IPO increased to 1.75 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering for Matrix Capital Corp was increased to 1.75 million shares from 1.5 million, lead underwriter Piper Jaffray Inc said Monday.</p>
<p>The offering of Matrix, a specialized financial services company, is expected to price between $9 and $11 a share and trade the week of October 21, the underwriter said.</p>
<p>The company has applied to trade on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol &quot;MTXC.&quot;</p>
</text>
